    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot the anti gravity glider with physics simulation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore open world with different planet areas. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover science fiction story about surviving of artificial intelligence. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy atmospheric peaceful flight without combat. </p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Peace Protocol is single player story driven science fiction open-world video game with artificial intelligence. Pilot the anti gravity glider, explore world, transports goods, repairs infrastructure and decide the true mission of AI life on the new planet.</p>",
